			<i>by persuasion, by fair means</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν δόλῳ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				102
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				612
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίᾳ</span>, <i><span class="en">
